{"final":{"2010_total_fair_value_billions":34.7,"2009_total_fair_value_billions":34.2,"sources":["source:q16n3","source:q16n5","source:q16n4","source:q16n6"],"calculation":"For each year, total segregated assets = segregated cash + fair value of segregated securities. 2010: 25.0 + 9.7 = 34.7 billion. 2009: 24.0 + 10.2 = 34.2 billion."}}